= 16 April 2025 — A campaign enters the ward

Braun and supporters enter the Oleśnica county hospital after a lawful abortion
in a high-risk pregnancy. He calls his action a citizen's detention of the
gynaecologist. The doctor says she is blocked from leaving an office and from
treating patients for more than an hour; prosecutors open an investigation into
alleged unlawful detention, physical contact and insults.

This is not a vote on the doctor's guilt or Braun's. Lewica can protect the
hospital and build a usable evidence record, seek a common institutional line,
or make the confrontation the centre of the abortion campaign.

