<div class="election-table-row"><span>Karol Nawrocki</span><span class="party party-pis">PiS-backed</span><b>[+ pres_2025_r1_right +]%</b><span>[? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 1 and pres_2025_winner_key = "right": elected?][? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 0 and (pres_2025_finalist_a_key = "right" or pres_2025_finalist_b_key = "right"): runoff?]</span></div>
<div class="election-table-row"><span>[+ pres_2025_left_candidate +]</span><span class="party party-lewica">Lewica</span><b>[+ pres_2025_r1_left +]%</b><span>[? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 1 and pres_2025_winner_key = "left": elected?][? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 0 and (pres_2025_finalist_a_key = "left" or pres_2025_finalist_b_key = "left"): runoff?]</span></div>
[? if not pres_2025_united_left: <div class="election-table-row"><span>[+ pres_2025_razem_candidate +]</span><span class="party party-razem">Razem</span><b>[+ pres_2025_r1_razem +]%</b><span>[? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 1 and pres_2025_winner_key = "razem": elected?][? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 0 and (pres_2025_finalist_a_key = "razem" or pres_2025_finalist_b_key = "razem"): runoff?]</span></div>?]
<div class="election-table-row"><span>Sławomir Mentzen</span><span class="party party-konf">Konf.</span><b>[+ pres_2025_r1_mentzen +]%</b><span>[? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 1 and pres_2025_winner_key = "mentzen": elected?][? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 0 and (pres_2025_finalist_a_key = "mentzen" or pres_2025_finalist_b_key = "mentzen"): runoff?]</span></div>
<div class="election-table-row"><span>Grzegorz Braun</span><span class="party party-kkp">KKP</span><b>[+ pres_2025_r1_braun +]%</b><span>[? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 1 and pres_2025_winner_key = "braun": elected?][? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 0 and (pres_2025_finalist_a_key = "braun" or pres_2025_finalist_b_key = "braun"): runoff?]</span></div>
<div class="election-table-row"><span>Szymon Hołownia</span><span class="party party-p2050">PL2050</span><b>[+ pres_2025_r1_holownia +]%</b><span>[? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 1 and pres_2025_winner_key = "holownia": elected?][? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 0 and (pres_2025_finalist_a_key = "holownia" or pres_2025_finalist_b_key = "holownia"): runoff?]</span></div>
<div class="election-table-row"><span>Krzysztof Stanowski</span><span>independent</span><b>[+ pres_2025_r1_stanowski +]%</b><span>[? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 1 and pres_2025_winner_key = "stanowski": elected?][? if pres_2025_first_round_winner = 0 and (pres_2025_finalist_a_key = "stanowski" or pres_2025_finalist_b_key = "stanowski"): runoff?]</span></div>
</div>

<div class="ledger-section"><div class="ledger-title">Two separate Left verdicts</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Player-backed candidate · [+ pres_2025_left_candidate +]</span><b>[+ pres_2025_player_result +]% · [+ pres_2025_candidate_band +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">Campaign expectation [+ pres_2025_candidate_expectation +]% · [? if pres_2025_candidate_expectation_gap >= 0: +?][+ pres_2025_candidate_expectation_gap +] points.</div>
[? if pres_2025_candidate_historical > 0: <div class="ledger-subrow">Personal historical comparator [+ pres_2025_candidate_historical +]% · [? if pres_2025_candidate_historical_gap >= 0: +?][+ pres_2025_candidate_historical_gap +] points.</div>?]
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Total Left field</span><b>[+ pres_2025_field_result +]% · [+ pres_2025_field_band +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">Campaign expectation [+ pres_2025_field_expectation +]% · [? if pres_2025_field_expectation_gap >= 0: +?][+ pres_2025_field_expectation_gap +] points. Historical Biejat–Zandberg field 9.09% · [? if pres_2025_field_historical_gap >= 0: +?][+ pres_2025_field_historical_gap +] points.</div>
[? if pres_2025_united_left: <div class="ledger-subrow">Nomination: [+ pres_2025_nomination_method +]. The common ticket is modelled through a [? if pres_2025_unity_effect >= 0: legitimacy gain of +[+ pres_2025_unity_effect +]?][? if pres_2025_unity_effect < 0: demobilisation cost of [+ pres_2025_unity_effect +]?] points before campaign and debate effects; it does not inherit the arithmetic 9.09%.</div>?]
[? if pres_2025_leadership_defeat: <div class="ledger-subrow"><b>Leadership defeat:</b> Biejat finished behind Zandberg. The strong combined field does not erase the challenge to New Left's leadership, donor network or claim to direct a future common list.</div>?]
<div class="ledger-subrow">Below 2.5%: shattering disaster · 2.5–4%: severe defeat · 4–5.5%: disappointing or ambiguous · 5.5–7.5%: base held · 7.5–10%: strong · 10%+: breakthrough · runoff/win: party-system transformation.</div>
[? if pres_2025_candidate_level = -3: <div class="ledger-subrow">A result below 2.5% opens a leadership challenge, loses [+ pres_feedback_donor_loss +] donor resources and [+ pres_feedback_activist_loss +] activist capacity, weakens media access, empowers faction demands and accelerates tactical flight.</div>?]
[? if pres_2025_candidate_level = 1: <div class="ledger-subrow">A broadly satisfying result stabilises the base, improves voter certainty and protects the party from immediate squeeze.</div>?]
<div class="ledger-subrow">The next monthly poll recalculates consideration and Left turnout. The feedback then decays over [+ pres_feedback_duration +] months unless another failure reinforces it.</div></div>

[? if pres_2025_first_round_winner: Elected in the first round: **[+
pres_2025_winner +] — [+ pres_2025_first_round_winner_share +]%**.?]
[? if not pres_2025_first_round_winner: Runoff: **[+ pres_2025_finalist_a +] vs
[+ pres_2025_finalist_b +]**?]

