= July 2025 — A meeting is evidence, not a verdict

After demanding a coalition renegotiation, Szymon Hołownia meets Adam Bielan;
Jarosław Kaczyński also attends. Public reporting establishes the meeting,
not whether it was ordinary dialogue, a bargaining bluff or an attempt to find
another majority.

[? if third_way_active: Third Way survived June. PSL can demand that talks
affecting the common electoral brand pass through a joint council, tolerate
each party's autonomy, or let suspicion reopen the argument over whether the
pact still binds anyone.?]
[? if third_way_split: Third Way has already divided. PSL and Poland 2050 now
answer for their own channels, while the coalition must test Hołownia's claims
against actual Sejm arithmetic.?]

