= 23 July 2025 — From viral act to a court file

After the European Parliament waived immunity in May and Braun appeared for
questioning on 3 July, prosecutors send seven alleged offences from 2022–23 to
the Warsaw district court. One count concerns the Sejm menorah; the others
remain separate alleged assaults, coercion, insults and property damage.

**Procedural preparation: [+ braun_procedure_score +].** The number reflects
the accumulated evidence, restraint and martyrdom record. It does not decide
guilt and it does not merge the separate Oleśnica investigation into this
indictment.

