[? if formation_2025_left_cabinet: Lewica enters the cabinet and receives
negotiated fiscal authority only now, after the successful vote. Its portfolio
allocation still has to match the coalition protocol.?]
[? if not formation_2025_left_cabinet: Lewica supplied investiture votes but
remains outside the cabinet. It has no ministries and no state budget
authority.?]

