new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.government_has_confidence = 0;
Q.caretaker_government = 1;
Q.coalition_broken = 1;
Q.formation_in_progress = 1;
Q.left_in_government = 0;
Q.razem_in_government = 0;
Q.left_cabinet_committed = 0;
Q.budget = 0;
Q.budget_authority =
    "Caretaker cabinet — no new discretionary spending authority";
Q.position = "Caretaker cabinet and formation talks";
Q.snap_formation_attempt = 1;
Q.snap_formation_context =
    "July 2025 first-attempt investiture failed — Sejm second attempt";
Q.snap_formation_candidate = Q.formation_2025_candidate;
Q.snap_formation_base =
    Number(Q.formation_2025_core_pool) || 0;
Q.snap_formation_left_votes =
    Number(Q.formation_2025_left_yes) || 0;
Q.snap_formation_left_abstentions =
    Number(Q.formation_2025_left_abstain) || 0;
Q.snap_formation_variance =
    Number(Q.formation_2025_variance) || 0;
Q.snap_formation_first_right = 0;
Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(
    78,
    Number(Q.early_election_risk) || 0
);
Q.public_trust -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "The first-attempt cabinet fails and initiative passes to the Sejm";
!}

= A failed vote remains failed

**[+ formation_2025_candidate +]** did not win the required absolute majority.
The candidate is not installed by narrative fiat. The outgoing cabinet remains
in caretaker office. The President's first attempt is now exhausted, so
initiative passes directly to the Sejm for the second Article 154 attempt.

